Taylor Swift has revealed when her relationship with Travis Kelce really started. The 33-year-old singer spoke candidly about the romance during a recent interview with Time after she was named the magazine’s 2023 Person of the Year. Speaking to the publication, she said she connected with Kelce in July, after he confessed on his podcast that he tried and failed to give her a friendship bracelet with his phone number on it during one of her Eras Tour shows. “This all started when Travis very adorably put me on blast on his podcast, which I thought was metal as hell,” she explained.

